{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 34, :comments ["<b>As YHWH commanded to do.</b> All seven days. And our Sages interpreted: <b>to do</b> — this is the rite of the [red] cow; <b>to atone</b> — this is the rite of the Day of Atonements. And to teach that a High Priest requires separation before the Day of Atonements for seven days — and so too the priest who burns the cow (Sifra)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:05:31.118549298Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}